 ## Edge cases
 
 - **Phased fallback transcripts**: degraded runs produce `...-output-phase2.txt` / `-phase3.txt` at top level. `*-output*.txt` covers them; `*-output.txt` would not.
 - **Claude assessor outputs**: `claude-plan-assessor-round-N.txt` ends in `-round-N.txt`, not `-output.txt`, so `claude-plan-*-output*.txt` does NOT match it. Assessor transcripts stay out of scope (intended).
