+- **Structured sidecars**: per-reviewer `.tsv` / `.jsonl` sit beside raw transcripts (reviewer-template contract); they are non-canonical aggregates and must be excluded alongside transcripts. Patterns use `*-output*.txt.tsv` / `*-output*.txt.jsonl` so phased basenames remain covered.
